            <div><span data-custom-class="body_text"><strong>Social Media Login Data.&nbsp;</strong>We may provide you with the option to register with us using your existing social media account details, like your Facebook, X, or other social media account. If you choose to register in this way, we will collect certain profile information about you from the social media provider, as described in the section called&nbsp;"<span data-custom-class="body_text"><a href="http://127.0.0.1:3000/views/privacy.ejs#sociallogins" data-custom-class="link">HOW DO WE HANDLE YOUR SOCIAL LOGINS?</a></span>"&nbsp;below.</span></div>
